# FlowTree — Configurações: flags, prioridades e reset do banco
# Leitura: módulo `tasks`. Escrita: módulo `settings` (admin passa).

@host = http://localhost:5100/api
@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI
@flagUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_FLAG
@priorityUuid = COLE_O_UUID_DA_PRIORIDADE

### Listar flags
GET {{host}}/flags
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar flag (slug gerado do nome)
POST {{host}}/flags
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Refatoração",
  "color": "#4c7570"
}

### Atualizar flag
PUT {{host}}/flags/{{flagUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Refatoração técnica",
  "color": "#6f8a63"
}

### Excluir flag
DELETE {{host}}/flags/{{flagUuid}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar prioridades (low, medium, high, urgent)
GET {{host}}/priorities
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Atualizar rótulo/cor de uma prioridade (slugs fixos)
PUT {{host}}/priorities/{{priorityUuid}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Alta",
  "color": "#4c7570"
}

### Resetar o banco com dados de demonstração (só admin)
POST {{host}}/maintenance/reset
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "mode": "demo"
}

### Resetar o banco deixando apenas o administrador logado
POST {{host}}/maintenance/reset
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "mode": "clean"
}
